      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791232561625,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "global memory through the shared L2 (6.96 TB/s peak);\natomics run in the L2; the per-CU L1s are not kept\ncoherent by hardware, so device-scope fences invalidate them",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 50,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "global memory through the shared L2 (6.96 TB/s peak);\natomics run in the L2; the per-CU L1s are not kept\ncoherent by hardware, so device-scope fences invalidate them",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
